    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Your task is to find 50 small mom-and-pop service businesses (painters, plumbers, handymen) that either lack a website or have outdated websites, located in Lake Stevens, Snohomish, Granite Falls, Arlington, and Everett, WA.\n\nReturn a JSON array with **exactly 50 business records**. For each business, include:\n\n- businessName\n- email (or \"Not available\")\n- phone (or \"Not available\")\n- city (or \"Not available\")\n- website (or \"Not available\")\n- emailDraft (a short, personalized cold outreach message offering a free consultation for a new website or better digital presence)\n\nOnly return raw JSON — **do not wrap the output in markdown, backticks, or explain anything**.\nReturn the array as native JSON — do not wrap it in quotes or format it as a string. Just return the actual array structure.\n\nIf the business data is sparse online, do not generate fake data AT ALL. All businesses\ndata you collect must be real. \n\n** DO NOT include these businesses: if you run into search results for the following businesses, do not include them in the final result: *\n\n{{ $json.blockedBusinesses }}\n\nBelow is a format example (DO NOT return this — it is just for structure):\n\n[\n  {\n    \"businessName\": \"Everett Painting Co.\",\n    \"email\": \"info@everettpainting.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"(425) 123-4567\",\n    \"city\": \"Everett\",\n    \"website\": \"https://everettpainting.com\",\n    \"emailDraft\": \"Hi there, I noticed your business and wanted to offer a free consultation...\"\n  },\n  ...\n]\n\n",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        640,
        0
      ],
      "id": "5ef753fc-a418-4c34-8ea3-a678d148e312",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
